<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd" identifier="pcb-item-f4536875efa9471e86a057d84164eaa5" title="Quick Check: Anonymous (precision)" adaptive="true" time-dependent="false">
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response><qti-value>C</qti-value></qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"/>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>show_interaction</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-item-body>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="show_interaction" outcome-identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" show-hide="show" class="qti-margin-0">
      <qti-content-body>
        <p>Choose the word that best completes the sentence.</p>
    <p>The witness gave a(n) ____ testimony in the courtroom because the suspect&apos;s associates had made threats against her safety.</p>
    <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="true" max-choices="1">
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="A">unidentified</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="B">unnamed</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="C">anonymous</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="D">incognito</qti-simple-choice>
    </qti-choice-interaction>
      </qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>

    <qti-feedback-block identifier="CORRECT" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Correct! Anonymous is most precise because it emphasizes the deliberate withholding of identity (the witness&apos;s name) for protection. An- (without) + onym (name) = without a name by choice. While &apos;unidentified&apos; suggests an unknown identity and &apos;unnamed&apos; merely means lacking a name, anonymous captures intentional concealment. &apos;Incognito&apos; implies active disguise or assumption of a false identity, which doesn&apos;t fit a legal deposition. Something or someone anonymous has an identity that is unknown or kept secret.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="INCORRECT" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Something or someone anonymous has an identity that is unknown or kept secret. Anonymous is most precise because it emphasizes the deliberate withholding of identity (the witness&apos;s name) for protection. An- (without) + onym (name) = without a name by choice. While &apos;unidentified&apos; suggests an unknown identity and &apos;unnamed&apos; merely means lacking a name, anonymous captures intentional concealment. &apos;Incognito&apos; implies active disguise or assumption of a false identity, which doesn&apos;t fit a legal deposition. All four words are close in meaning, but the best fit here is: &quot;anonymous&quot;</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
  </qti-item-body>
  <qti-response-processing>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-correct identifier="RESPONSE"/></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">1</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">CORRECT</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">completed</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">hidden</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-if>
      <qti-response-else>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">INCORRECT</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      </qti-response-else>
    </qti-response-condition>
  </qti-response-processing>
</qti-assessment-item>